#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A block theme for podcast websites. A home page with a bold hero and the latest episodes, episode pages with a sticky audio player, series archives, search results grouped by type and five style variations (Elena, Chiara, Morgana, Viola, Rosa). Every section can be styled from Design → Styles → Blocks. Works best with Podcast Core Engine, which adds episodes, series, the audio player and import from your podcast RSS feed; without it the theme works as a clean blog theme."
msgstr ""

